                                "sense_id": "b6fba8f3-b324-3b31-841e-57d7283de2a0",
                                "text": "Snakes hang thick from the cypress trees / Like sausage on a smokehouse wall."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "707ee777-1b4e-33a9-8ffe-ed1209af452f",
